<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン後部座席夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Good work! We're here!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE>Auntie<STYLE ID="1">, your driving has gotten much better."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"How many years do you think I've been married into this family? Of course it has!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The high-school group was completely knocked out...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I opened the car door, a slightly lukewarm wind blew for a moment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> still alive back there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ぐったり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> looked as if she had fainted with her eyes open.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Oh my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you carsick?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Let me carry you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n960\r\n500\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n960\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spoke to her, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> slid swiftly out of the car without a change of expression.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\生け垣.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田桜1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Here it is, the Niimura main house!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Where the car had stopped stood a hedge about 3 meters high.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And beyond it...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n540\r\n2000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n000\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">From what seemed to be the garden, a large cherry tree towered higher than anything else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was probably several hundred years old.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even now, the old tree proudly showed off its cherry blossoms in full bloom.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"What an amazing cherry tree..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's every bit as amazing as the goshinboku in Motoki-cho, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Its size, its imposing presence, its </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="かんろく">dignity</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In every respect, I could see a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="こうごう">divine</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> majesty that matched the goshinboku in Motoki-cho, no, that surpassed it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-317\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-317\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Next to that cherry tree stood a large wooden house.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"This is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s family home...? You can really feel the history."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was a big house, worthy of being called the main house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Starting today, we would be guests here for two nights and three days.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">All the same, what is this wind?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Like nothing I've ever felt before... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It isn't a warning, and it isn't a premonition either.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">A settlement with no streetlights, just a few houses standing here and there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A place the phrase "cut off from the world" fit perfectly, truly a foreign land isolated from everything around it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This was the Arata settlement.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ぐったり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I picked up our bags, lent </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> my shoulder, and headed for the house.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm alive, somehow... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Was I really right to tag along with you two...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I want to go home already... Operation failed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I almost said it had only just started, but I had the sense to hold back.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At least she seemed able to walk.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\dark_attack.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎幽霊.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Eek!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what's wrong...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just now... I definitely...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> looked where I was looking, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Just now, over there, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was gone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It had been awfully clear for a trick of the eyes...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"He probably came out because the thirteenth-year memorial service is coming up..."</STYLE> [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Logic-obsessed </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who didn't believe in ghosts, had given up thinking and was saying whatever came to mind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Is that... what it is...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For a while, I stared at that spot, already swallowed by darkness.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="9">Mother</STYLE>, we're back!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Obasan<STYLE ID="2"> called out as she opened the sliding front door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Any minute now, <STYLE ID="9">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE> will be here!
{PAUSE ""}
　She's the head of the Arata settlement, so make sure you greet her properly!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the head of this place, the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The person who rules over this insular space, cut off from the rest of the world.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">From what I'd heard, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would be running all of tomorrow's memorial service.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, she's an amazing person who also serves in the role of a monk or a priest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I was starting to get a little nervous.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> spoke to me in a low voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"When you meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, don't make any weird noises, whatever you do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's... I don't get it either."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Did she look that incredible?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I imagined this and that, but none of it clicked.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At the very least, she was the person who led this Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She was probably some kind of elder.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ春花ミニ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "170" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">I could see a figure at the far end of the hallway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was slowly walking toward us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was that </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Haruka's grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<BR>
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Then, all of a sudden, it broke into a run toward us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"You guys! You're late! I got sick of waiting!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The old woman straining to put on a young voice was wearing a knit dress like the ones </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wears, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and had the same hairstyle as </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Her way of talking was exactly like </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But she was clearly around 70 at least.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Who? This person...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">G-Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, been a while. So this time you're doing me..."</STYLE>
