{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Haha! So you're </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">!</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> and </STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="9"> have told me plenty about you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s grandmother, Erika Niimura! Same here, nice to meet you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Was she still doing her </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> impression, or was this just how she talked?</STYLE>
