{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"A-Anyway, I'm fine, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are worn out from the long trip, so let them get some rest soon."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Right then! Sure thing! Sit tight till it's time to eat!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm not that foul-mouthed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"What're you talking about! To everyone else, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'re exactly like this!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Just go take a crap and wait till the food's ready!"</STYLE><PG>
