{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I've never said anything like that! You </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">cosplay hag</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Don't waste time on </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">this one</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, let's get going!"</STYLE>
