<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sprawled out spread-eagle in the room we'd been given.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was a Japanese-style room on the second floor.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"H-Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Your grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is a, w-, unique person..."</STYLE>
