{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, thought so. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">My grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s been like that forever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Every time, she greets people doing impressions of all sorts of people, or in cosplay."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Cosplay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, the thing is, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s a huge anime otaku... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">She's got all kinds of costumes in her room."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I-I see..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"For some reason, I get made to do impressions of </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sometimes, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
