<STYLE ID="2">Would </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> doing impressions of </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> ever come in handy for anything?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
