<STYLE ID="2">Pretending to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> to lure someone into a </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="わな">trap</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE><PG>
