<STYLE ID="2">I went alone to the first-floor veranda that looked out on the garden.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said she would rest a little longer, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said she would help with dinner and went to the kitchen.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">A large moon had come out in the sky, lighting the old cherry tree </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="さんさん">brilliantly</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A faint wind brushed the old tree, lifting the cherry blossoms fluttering into the air and toying with them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">A very pleasant wind.</STYLE>
